<sup>2</sup>/<sub>7</sub> = 0.2857 = 29%
LITERAL_53F4_10AF_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6, $choice_7, $choice_8, $choice_9);
